            <ArticleTitle>[Metabolic curietherapy with P-32 in bone metastases in breast cancer].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>101-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The administration of radioactive phosphorus (P-32) for the treatment of pain in metastatic bone lesions from breast cancer shows palliative effects lasting three to nine months. The evolution of the disease is not modified.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
